  "title": "Rival's Secret Son",
  "subtitle": "\"I slept with my professional rival once. I paid for that night with four years of silence and one little boy with his eyes.\"",
  "penName": "Mira Belgrave",
  "genre": "enemiesToLovers",
  "hook": "Four years ago I slept with the only man in my industry who was more successful than I was. I got pregnant. I told him once. He was on a plane to Singapore and asked me to repeat myself, and I heard his partner ask him who it was, and I said *nobody* and hung up. My son is named Oscar. He has his father's eyes and my mother's laugh and zero knowledge of the man who has now been hired as my new boss. Ryan Delacroix walked into my office on a Tuesday morning. Oscar's photograph was on my desk.",
